Heat Rate.  Shall mean the actual fuel energy consumed during the Performance Test determined from the actual lower heating value of the fuel multiplied by the quantity of fuel consumed and expressed in BTU, divided by the Electrical Output measured in kWh at the generator terminals during the Performance Tests in accordance with the testing guidelines set forth in Exhibit F, expressed as BTU/kWh(LHV).

