In no case shall the CO emission from any individual Unit (regardless of the number of Units at the Facility) exceed 56 ppmvd @ 15% O2 at loads of 60-100% of Base Load at Basis Conditions.  Subject to the provisions of Section 10.12.8 if the Adjusted Emissions of a Unit are less than Emissions Guarantee values, Seller will be considered to have satisfactorily caused the Unit to have met the Specific Performance requirement associated with the Emission Guarantee.  The above NOx and CO guarantees must include ambient contribution for NOx and CO.

