Following the commissioning functional checks or Performance Test as applicable, or additional running of the Facility for such diagnostic purposes, Seller shall at its own expense:

repair at the Site such parts of the Unit(s); or
remove the defective parts and provide and install the new parts, 
to cause such failed Unit(s) to meet Specific Performance Levels (such election subject to Purchaser’s approval, such approval shall not be unreasonably withheld).
If such failed Unit(s) still fail to satisfy Specific Performance Levels, Seller shall at its own expense make such further repair or replacement until the Units meet Specific Performance Levels.

